Package: mcprack-sync-claude
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-mcprack-client,
Description: keep Claude Desktop MCP config in sync with mcprack
 Fetches the user's selected MCP servers from a mcprack instance and merges
 them into Claude Desktop's claude_desktop_config.json (or Claude Code's
 ~/.claude.json with --claude-code). Includes an optional systemd user timer.
